<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak January foreign trade deficit SKK 7.06 bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak January foreign trade deficit SKK 7.06 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak foreign trade deficit totalled 7.061 billion crowns in January, compared with a deficit of 2.125 billion crowns in January 1996, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
